Create familiar makes pets that are useful as a screen for very
powerful monsters.  It even makes random monsters some of the
time and makes them pets if they are capable of it.  This is
*extremely* powerful for folks who do use pets.  Hint - read
ascension posts and you'll see that regular ascenders use pets
a lot.

Create monster turns any character who has it into a super
being after a long altar camping sequence.

Remove curse changes the character of all of the items in the
game once you can cast it reliably.

These are more powerful than most spells in the other schools.



